message: "If you use SPPS Planner or SPPS Planner-derived workflows in academic work, please cite this software and the corresponding release DOI when available."
title: "SPPS Planner: Solid-Phase Peptide Synthesis Planning and Evidence-Driven Decision Support"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Woo"
    given-names: "Sanghun"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SanghunWoo-23/SPPS-PLANNER"
url: "https://github.com/SanghunWoo-23/SPPS-PLANNER"
version: "5.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-04"
abstract: >-
  SPPS Planner is a Windows-first desktop application for solid-phase peptide
  synthesis planning, editable workflow calculation, material/checklist/batch
  generation, experimental record traceability, and evidence-driven Loading and
  Cleavage decision support.
keywords:
  - peptide
  - SPPS
  - solid-phase peptide synthesis
  - peptide synthesis
  - laboratory software
  - decision support
  - experimental data
